==Description==
'''Dead Stare''' is a sticker unlocked by achieving Level 5 on the premium track of the [[Spring Frenzy Battle Pass]]. At that Level, it cost {{Bunz|120}} or {{Robux|70}}. The total cost was {{Bunz|370}} or {{Robux|210}}.

==Appearance==
The sticker showcases a greyscale default [[Commander]] head which has a deadpan stare. An ominous sound plays upon use.

==Trivia==
*The sticker is likely a reference to the [[wp:Thousand-yard stare|Two Thousand Yard Stare]].

==Update History==
*'''3 April 2026''' - [[v1.88.0]]
**'''Dead Stare''' added.
*'''11 June 2026''' - [[v2.0.0|v2.0.8a]]
